" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 - 5,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150125153121&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goldfish_Bowl_e69fd6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a goldfish bowl.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 32.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>To catch a Small Fish, you need to go to an <a href=\"#/wiki/Underwater\">underwater</a> area, such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Calassa\">Calassa</a>, or the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Quarter\">Sunken Quarter</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>. You need to use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Empty%20Goldfish%20Bowl\">Empty Goldfish Bowl</a> on a patch of Coral or Kelp which has a fish swimming around it. Only rarely will you see a fish occupying a square all by itself, but these can be caught too. After you used the empty bowl on the fish, you will have a goldfish inside the bowl.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Goldfish%20Bowl%20%28Immobile%29\">Goldfish Bowl (Object)</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishnapped%20Goldfish\">Fishnapped Goldfish</a>.\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Calassa fish\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"83\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Calassa_fish_c1c10b.jpg\" width=\"243\"/></span>\nNeeded for <a href=\"#/quest/the-travelling-trader-quest\">The Travelling Trader Quest</a>. Can be obtained from an <a href=\"#/wiki/Unrealized%20Dream\">Unrealized Dream</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Decorations</li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Empty%20Goldfish%20Bowl\">Empty Goldfish Bowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fishnapped%20Goldfish\">Fishnapped Goldfish</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goldfish%20Bowl%20%28Immobile%29\">Goldfish Bowl (Immobile)</a></li><li>Kelp</li><li>Living and Dead</li><li>Note Pinned on the Wall</li><li>Other Objects</li><li>Silent Pet</li><li>Small Fish</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-travelling-trader-quest\">The Travelling Trader Quest</a></li><li>Transmutator</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Unrealized%20Dream\">Unrealized Dream</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-travelling-trader-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-travelling-trader-quest","quest":"The Travelling Trader Quest","step":"5-1","n":22,"title":"Arranjar o aquário com peixe","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":32981,"y":31190,"z":13,"label":"Peixe dourado (local 1)"},{"x":32932,"y":31187,"z":10,"label":"Peixe dourado (local 2)"},{"x":32941,"y":31134,"z":13,"label":"Peixe dourado (local 3)"},{"x":32949,"y":31182,"z":7,"label":"Sunken Quarter (entrada, Yalahar)"},{"x":32298,"y":32896,"z":6,"label":"Captain Max (docas de Liberty Bay)"}]}]}}